WEBVTT

00:00:58.888 --> 00:01:02.683
I think my life has been
a reasonably unique and unusual one.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:07.063
Now in my early forties,
I've had careers as an opera singer,

00:01:07.105 --> 00:01:08.898
a Catholic priest,

00:01:08.940 --> 00:01:10.817
a corporate lawyer,

00:01:10.858 --> 00:01:12.485
and now, a management consultant.

00:01:12.485 --> 00:01:15.863
(Laughter)

00:01:15.905 --> 00:01:18.741
And when people
hear the careers that I've had,

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:20.660
the most common question I get asked --

00:01:20.701 --> 00:01:22.453
maybe the one that's on your mind --

00:01:22.453 --> 00:01:24.956
is, “What on earth is
the connection amongst it all?”

00:01:24.956 --> 00:01:26.082
(Laughter)

00:01:26.999 --> 00:01:29.252
Through all of these changes,

00:01:29.293 --> 00:01:31.420
through all of these careers,